| delete a wire by uid | `delete_by_uid(path, "Wire", uid, tag)` — `tools/recipes/build_d1_m3a1.py:583` (*"report_all(cls) -> .index(uid) -> delete_object(cls, idx). The shape cycle 58 used; no new verb."*; there is no by-uid delete in the fleet — `tools/recipes/stage_d1_s3a_focus_ind.py:485-488`) |
| reach a tunnel's terminal | `step_6_sixth_row` — `tools/recipes/build_d1_m3a1.py:1530`, implementing Pre-decided 72/74 (`docs/cycle27-plan.md:2866-2876`, `:2893-2907`): owner chain → the owning **structure node's** `Terms[]` → the entry that **exposes the tunnel's uid**, never a carried index (that is what broke T2c2) |
